Sokha is sixteen. Breakfast time is at six thirty. His commute to school takes twenty minutes by motorbike taxi. He has a free period on Tuesdays. At lunch break, he eats with friends. After school, he goes to the gym, and on Saturdays he has a part-time job in a café. His bedtime routine: he doesn't scroll on his phone after ten!

